Hefdah changes: Persian instructions and examples; one entrypoint and 13 modes;
conservative Unicode handling; Persian number parsing; explicit per-client
context; editorial diagnostics without AI-authorship or virality prediction;
RTL HTML carousel; chat bundle and additive installer.
Python helpers are newly implemented for this package, not a translated copy
of the upstream scripts. Hook IDs are Hefdah-local, not an upstream classifier map.
Sample texts and figures are demonstrations, not client outcomes.

